  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You impose a single behavioral override on a beast or plant creature with CR &le; your proficiency bonus. The creature obeys a three-word command (Move here; Attack him; Stand still) for up to 1 hour without repeated saves. It does not understand why it obeys. The compulsion is biological, not magical.</p><p><em>At Higher Levels: +1 to CR cap per slot level above 2nd.</em></p>",
